tools/

# OS
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# --- vercel, keep as ONE block ---------------------------------------------
# `vercel link` appends its own .vercel and .env* lines to this file every
# time it runs, and it can write them with CRLF endings. Keeping these two
# entries together as a single commented block means a second `vercel link`
# produces a visible duplicate that is obvious in review, instead of
# silently stacking another copy somewhere else in the file.
# `.env.local` holds a VERCEL_OIDC_TOKEN. It must never be committed.
# See ARCHITECTURE.md section 8.
.vercel
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
# --- end vercel block ------------------------------------------------------
